SUMMARY:[Threads] Finished piece: "Example: Two chairs"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example: Two chairs (stage listed\, prints)\nWHY: The pay
 off post. Shoot it properly. This image gets reused for the listing\, the 
 prints\, the pins\, and the newsletter.\nSHOT: Straight on\, even daylight
 \, no glare\, cropped to the edges / One shot in a room or leaning on a wa
 ll for scale / One tight detail\nCAPTION: Title\, size\, medium. Then one 
 line about what it ended up being about. Then whether it is available.\nAS
 K: DM to collect / link in bio / prints coming.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up
  to 500 chars\, 1-10 images\, or short video. Lead with a line that stands
  alone. Post the image\, say one true thing about it\, ask one question.\n
 TIME: about 20 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.com/anna/
CATEGORIES:Threads,post
URL:https://brianolek.com/anna/
