SUMMARY:[Threads] Sold / collector: "Example: Night kitchen"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example: Night kitchen (stage sold)\nWHY: Social proof. E
 very sale is a post. The packed box\, the piece on the collector's wall\, 
 the thank you.\nSHOT: The packed order with the label / Collector's photo 
 of it hung (ask for one) / The empty spot on the studio wall\nCAPTION: Thi
 s one went to [city]. Thank you. One line about what it meant.\nASK: Menti
 on what is still available\, lightly.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 ch
 ars\, 1-10 images\, or short video. Lead with a line that stands alone. Po
 st the image\, say one true thing about it\, ask one question.\nTIME: abou
 t 10 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.com/anna/
CATEGORIES:Threads,post
URL:https://brianolek.com/anna/
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:[Threads] Sold / collector: "Example: Night kitchen"
TRIGGER:-PT10M
END:VALARM
