SUMMARY:[Threads] Concept: "Example: Garden study (idea)"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example: Garden study (idea) (stage idea)\nWHY: Let peopl
 e in at the start so they feel invested by the time it is finished. This i
 s what makes the reveal land.\nSHOT: Sketchbook page\, reference\, a color
  swatch\, a photo of the blank canvas / Or no image: a sentence about the 
 idea\nCAPTION: What you are chasing in this piece\, in one or two sentence
 s. Not what it is\, what it is about.\nASK: Ask a question people can answ
 er with one word.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 chars\, 1-10 images\, 
 or short video. Lead with a line that stands alone. Post the image\, say o
 ne true thing about it\, ask one question.\nTIME: about 10 min\n\nOpen the
  app: https://brianolek.com/anna/
