SUMMARY:[Threads] Finished piece: "Example: Red interior"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example: Red interior (stage finished\, drop 2026-10-24\,
  prints)\nWHY: The payoff post. Shoot it properly. This image gets reused 
 for the listing\, the prints\, the pins\, and the newsletter.\nSHOT: Strai
 ght on\, even daylight\, no glare\, cropped to the edges / One shot in a r
 oom or leaning on a wall for scale / One tight detail\nCAPTION: Title\, si
 ze\, medium. Then one line about what it ended up being about. Then whethe
 r it is available.\nASK: DM to collect / link in bio / prints coming.\nFOR
 MAT (Threads): Text up to 500 chars\, 1-10 images\, or short video. Lead w
 ith a line that stands alone. Post the image\, say one true thing about it
 \, ask one question.\nTIME: about 20 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianole
 k.com/anna/
