DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example: Two chairs (stage listed\, prints)\nWHY: Five pi
 ns in one sitting. Finished pieces\, prints in rooms\, process stills. Eac
 h one links to the shop.\nSHOT: Reuse the reveal and prints photos\, cropp
 ed 2:3\nCAPTION: Searchable title: 'original oil painting figure study' be
 ats a clever one here.\nASK: Link to shop.\nFORMAT (Pinterest): One batch 
