SUMMARY:[Threads] The story behind it: "Example: Two chairs"
DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example: Two chairs (stage listed\, prints)\nWHY: The why
 . This is the post that turns a liker into a buyer. Text does the work\, t
 he image just needs to be there.\nSHOT: The finished piece\, or a detail o
 f it\nCAPTION: Where the idea came from\, what happened while making it\, 
 what it means now. 3-6 sentences. Honest beats clever.\nASK: If this one s
 peaks to you\, it is available. Link.\nFORMAT (Threads): Text up to 500 ch
 ars\, 1-10 images\, or short video. Lead with a line that stands alone. Po
 st the image\, say one true thing about it\, ask one question.\nTIME: abou
 t 15 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.com/anna/
