  piece\, or a detail of it\nCAPTION: Where the idea came from\, what happe
 ned while making it\, what it means now. 3-6 sentences. Honest beats cleve
 r.\nASK: If this one speaks to you\, it is available. Link.\nFORMAT (Threa
 ds): Text up to 500 chars\, 1-10 images\, or short video. Lead with a line
  that stands alone. Post the image\, say one true thing about it\, ask one
  question.\nTIME: about 15 min\n\nOpen the app: https://brianolek.com/anna
 /
CATEGORIES:Threads,post
