DESCRIPTION:WORK: Example: Figure at the window (stage in-progress\, Replac
 e these example rows with Anna's real works. Stages: idea\, in-progress\, 
 finished\, listed\, sold\, archived.)\nWHY: Reach. Process video is how st
 rangers find the work. One recording session a week feeds three platforms.
 \nSHOT: Phone on a tripod\, 9:16\, over the shoulder or straight on / Reco
 rd 10-20 minutes of real painting\, cut to the best 20-45 seconds / End on
  a pull-back of the whole canvas\nCAPTION: On-screen text or voiceover: wh
 at you were thinking during this part. Keep it human.\nASK: Follow to see 
 it finished.\nFORMAT (TikTok): 9:16 vertical\, 15-60s. First frame is the 
 most interesting moment of the painting\, not a logo. Voiceover or on-scre
 en text telling what you were thinking.\nTIME: about 60 min\n\nOpen the ap
 p: https://brianolek.com/anna/
